  "details": "<p>The \u201cYesemek Quarry and Sculpture Workshop\u201d is located 23 km southeast of the Islahiye district on the West hills of Karatepe (Aslanl\u0131tepe) in the Yesemek Village. The site was added to the tentative list of UNESCO World Heritage Sites in 2012.</p>",
